  "NEOW.talk.RIMEDANCERMOD-RIMEDANCER_MOD.0-2.ancient": "[sine]enemy... ...of your..... enemy...[/sine]",
  
  "NEOW.talk.RIMEDANCERMOD-RIMEDANCER_MOD.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]...The.. Atlas...\n....break.. your.. ...chains....[/sine]",
  
  "NEOW.talk.RIMEDANCERMOD-RIMEDANCER_MOD.2-0.ancient": "[sine]...I.. can’t... ..make...\n...you.. forget....[/sine]",
